## 1. Introduction

The stock market provides investors with opportunities to invest in companies and participate in their growth. This report analyzes three major US-listed technology companies: **Apple Inc., Microsoft Corporation, and NVIDIA Corporation**.

The analysis focuses on **price trends, P/E ratio, market capitalization, recent news, and performance indicators**. These companies were selected because of their strong global presence and their important roles in consumer technology, cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and semiconductor industries.

