## 2. Apple Inc. (AAPL)

### Company Overview

Apple Inc. is one of the world's leading technology companies. It develops and sells products such as the iPhone, Mac, iPad, Apple Watch and AirPods. Apple also generates significant revenue from services such as the App Store, iCloud, Apple Music and other subscription-based services.

